---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Node as ContextHelp Node
    participant LocalDB as Local Storage
    participant SyncedReg as Synced Registry Data
    participant RegA as Registry A (Remote)
    participant RegB as Registry B (Remote)

    Note over User,RegB: Multi-Source Retrieval Flow

    User->>Node: ctxt search "ui hero patterns"

    Node->>Node: Parse query → AST
    Node->>Node: Generate query plan

    par Query Local
        Node->>LocalDB: SELECT FROM bookmarks<br/>WHERE match(...)
        LocalDB-->>Node: Local results (set A)
    and Query Synced Registries
        Node->>SyncedReg: SELECT FROM synced_bookmarks<br/>WHERE match(...)
        SyncedReg-->>Node: Synced results (set B)
    and Query Remote Registry A
        Node->>RegA: GET /bookmarks?q=ui+hero+patterns
        activate RegA
        RegA-->>Node: 200 OK (results set C)
        deactivate RegA
    and Query Remote Registry B
        Node->>RegB: GET /bookmarks?q=ui+hero+patterns
        activate RegB
        RegB-->>Node: 200 OK (results set D)
        deactivate RegB
    end

    Node->>Node: Merge results (A ∪ B ∪ C ∪ D)
    Node->>Node: Deduplicate by ID/URL
    Node->>Node: Apply reranking:<br/>- Reciprocal rank fusion<br/>- Registry weights<br/>- Recency scoring<br/>- Entity signal strength

    Node-->>User: Unified result set (ranked)

    Note over User,RegB: Results appear as single coherent system<br/>despite multiple sources
